WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:01.880
It is I

00:05.120 --> 00:06.520
This official Chu Maolun

00:06.880 --> 00:08.880
Pays respects to Prince of Jin

00:12.600 --> 00:14.120
A dog by the horse

00:14.200 --> 00:16.400
How dare you call yourself a Xuan official?

00:16.480 --> 00:17.560
Your subject

00:17.640 --> 00:19.040
No

00:19.240 --> 00:21.320
This foreign official once served in Xuan Kingdom

00:21.400 --> 00:23.067
As prefect of Shuoyang Prefecture

00:23.360 --> 00:24.400
This area around Yiyang

00:24.480 --> 00:26.680
Was once under this foreign official's jurisdiction

00:26.760 --> 00:28.400
This foreign official heard that Prince of Jin

00:28.480 --> 00:30.147
Led the royal army north

00:30.640 --> 00:32.400
Today I risk death to come

00:32.480 --> 00:34.000
To offer Prince of Jin

00:34.080 --> 00:36.520
A strategy to lift the siege of Yiyang

00:36.600 --> 00:37.120
I hope

00:37.200 --> 00:38.920
Your Highness will permit this foreign official and others

00:39.000 --> 00:40.840
To enter the city for detailed discussion

